{"id":"caliente","lemma":"caliente","pos":"adj","rank":743,"glosses":["hot, warm (emitting heat or warmth)","hot (close to finding or guessing something)","horny (sexually aroused)"],"ipa":"/kaˈljente/","forms":{"femininePlural":"calientes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d1/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-caliente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sé que está caliente.","en":"I know it's hot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441581"},{"text":"Los huevos todavía están calientes.","en":"The eggs are still hot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/50373"},{"text":"La habitación estaba caliente.","en":"The room was hot.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444197"},{"text":"Mis pies están calientes.","en":"My feet are warm."},{"text":"¿El café está caliente?","en":"Is the coffee hot?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/800451"}]}